---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const en = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/en/');
---

<Base title="隐私说明 · 左二">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <h1>隐私说明</h1>
  </section>
  {en ? (
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This is a static blog with no account system and no analytics or
        advertising cookies. Full-text search runs in your browser and does not
        send search terms to an external search service.
      </p>
      <p>
        Open-source fonts are self-hosted alongside the pages; no external font
        service is contacted. The hosting provider may retain request logs.
      </p>
      <p>
        First-party visit statistics retain anonymized IP identifiers, masked
        network prefixes, page paths, referral domains and device categories for
        90 days. Full IPs, search terms and URL query parameters are not stored.
        Counts estimate visitors by IP and do not indicate that an article was
        finished. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control are respected.
        Detailed statistics are accessible only on the owner's local network.
      </p>
      <p>
        Comments connect to third-party services only when Giscus is configured
        and you choose to load them. A GitHub account is required to
        participate.
      </p>
      <a href="/">← Back to home</a>
    </div>
  ) : (
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        本站为静态博客，没有账户系统，不设置分析或广告
        Cookie。全文搜索在浏览器中运行，不会将搜索词发送给站外搜索服务。
      </p>
      <p>
        本站使用自托管的开源字体，字体文件与页面由同一站点提供，不连接外部字体服务。
        站点托管服务可能记录请求日志。
      </p>
      <p>
        评论仅在配置 Giscus 并由读者主动点击加载时连接第三方服务，参与讨论需要
        GitHub 账户。
      </p>
      <p>
        本站提供第一方访问统计，保留匿名 IP
        标识、脱敏网段、页面路径、来源域名和设备类别 90 天，不保存完整
        IP、搜索词或 URL 查询参数。阅读人数按匿名 IP
        估算，不代表读完文章；共享网络或更换 IP 会影响人数。尊重 Do Not Track 和
        Global Privacy Control；详细统计只在作者内网开放。
      </p>
      <a href="/">← 返回首页</a>
    </div>
  )}
</Base>
